#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Back to the main menu. %hs does the same on every line of this page. Every key and controller "
"button except the 5 menu keys still reaches the game while this menu is open, so you can keep "
"driving."
msgstr ""
"Späť do hlavného menu. %hs robí to isté na každom riadku tejto stránky. Každý kláves a tlačidlo "
"ovládača okrem 5 klávesov menu stále prichádza do hry, keď je menu otvorené, takže môžete ďalej "
"jazdiť."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Press ONE new key or controller button for %ls: any key, also another menu key (it is taken from "
"it). Keys / buttons already held now are ignored until released. Esc or Backspace cancels, so "
"does 10 s without a press; menu keys cannot be cleared here."
msgstr ""
"Stlačte JEDEN nový kláves alebo tlačidlo ovládača pre %ls: ľubovoľný kláves, aj iný kláves menu "
"(bude mu odobraný). Klávesy / tlačidlá práve držané sa ignorujú, kým ich nepustíte. Esc alebo "
"Backspace zruší, rovnako 10 s bez stlačenia; klávesy menu sa tu nedajú vymazať."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Press ONE new key (Shift / Ctrl / Alt with it make a combination) or controller button / D-pad "
"direction. Keys / buttons already held now (a shifter gear) are ignored until released; axes "
"never bind. %hs or Esc cancels, Backspace clears to none, 10 s without a press cancels."
msgstr ""
"Stlačte JEDEN nový kláves (Shift / Ctrl / Alt s ním tvoria kombináciu) alebo tlačidlo ovládača / "
"smer D-padu. Klávesy / tlačidlá práve držané (rýchlosť radiacej páky) sa ignorujú, kým ich "
"nepustíte; osi sa nikdy nepriradia. %hs alebo Esc zruší, Backspace vymaže na žiadny, 10 s bez "
"stlačenia zruší."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"One of the 5 keys that drive this menu (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, then press the new key or button: the "
"other menu keys can be taken too. These lines cannot be cleared, and each of the 5 must keep a "
"binding (a press that leaves another one empty is refused). Saved to dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Jeden z 5 klávesov, ktoré ovládajú toto menu (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, potom stlačte nový kláves alebo "
"tlačidlo: dajú sa prevziať aj iné klávesy menu. Tieto riadky sa nedajú vymazať a každý z 5 musí "
"mať priradenie (stlačenie, po ktorom by iný ostal prázdny, sa odmietne). Ukladá sa hneď do "
"dlaa.ini."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
